      "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/206b39fbe7ffce175ccb946e50dfb20b.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/206b39fbe7ffce175ccb946e50dfb20b.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/206b39fbe7ffce175ccb946e50dfb20b.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Lost Castle. R U READY for some challenge?</h2><br><br>Guided by an old treasure map, Jess is now standing in front of a castle. With all these ruins around, the castle seems to be abandoned for a long time.<br><br>A light glittering at the top of the castle, exuding a feeling of mysterious... Jess knows, this won't be an easy adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/8e3da3cc89d9396853e163771b6be0b2.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/8e3da3cc89d9396853e163771b6be0b2.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/8e3da3cc89d9396853e163771b6be0b2.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search every inch of the castle, discover the secret of it, gather all the item it needs to finish the game;<br></li><li>Some monsters have entrenched themselves in the deep of the castle, defeat them to make your way into the central of castle;<br></li><li>Find out the chests laying in the corner of castle, notice all the hints that were given.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/d13e87a4093cd66c31da0aafe8f8604c.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/d13e87a4093cd66c31da0aafe8f8604c.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/d13e87a4093cd66c31da0aafe8f8604c.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Well-designed game map, shortcuts inspiring players to discover &amp; gather;<br></li><li>Light, physical, movement, jigsaw, maze, number...all kinds of puzzle waiting for your challenge;<br></li><li>Use different functions of your weapon to defeat enemies or get through special obstacles.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/e7cc475ffb576b4e1b41bd56ef577323.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/e7cc475ffb576b4e1b41bd56ef577323.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/e7cc475ffb576b4e1b41bd56ef577323.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sound of the devs</h2><br><br>Hi everyone, it is a pleasure to bring you our first game <i>Dawn of the Lost Castle</i><br><br>As a big fan of <i>Castlevania</i>, I wanted the game to contains more exploration elements and more fights. But it didn't go well since we all lack of experiences and funds to extend the development period.  <br><br>But this won't be the end of <i>Dawn of the Lost Castle</i>, neither it will be our last game. So if you have any suggestions, please let us know through Steam Discussion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/c35338f3a915bc3db8395a8c98daa732.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/c35338f3a915bc3db8395a8c98daa732.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/c35338f3a915bc3db8395a8c98daa732.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
      "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/206b39fbe7ffce175ccb946e50dfb20b.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/206b39fbe7ffce175ccb946e50dfb20b.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/206b39fbe7ffce175ccb946e50dfb20b.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Lost Castle. R U READY for some challenge?</h2><br><br>Guided by an old treasure map, Jess is now standing in front of a castle. With all these ruins around, the castle seems to be abandoned for a long time.<br><br>A light glittering at the top of the castle, exuding a feeling of mysterious... Jess knows, this won't be an easy adventure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/8e3da3cc89d9396853e163771b6be0b2.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/8e3da3cc89d9396853e163771b6be0b2.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/8e3da3cc89d9396853e163771b6be0b2.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search every inch of the castle, discover the secret of it, gather all the item it needs to finish the game;<br></li><li>Some monsters have entrenched themselves in the deep of the castle, defeat them to make your way into the central of castle;<br></li><li>Find out the chests laying in the corner of castle, notice all the hints that were given.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/d13e87a4093cd66c31da0aafe8f8604c.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/d13e87a4093cd66c31da0aafe8f8604c.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/d13e87a4093cd66c31da0aafe8f8604c.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Well-designed game map, shortcuts inspiring players to discover &amp; gather;<br></li><li>Light, physical, movement, jigsaw, maze, number...all kinds of puzzle waiting for your challenge;<br></li><li>Use different functions of your weapon to defeat enemies or get through special obstacles.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/e7cc475ffb576b4e1b41bd56ef577323.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/e7cc475ffb576b4e1b41bd56ef577323.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/e7cc475ffb576b4e1b41bd56ef577323.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sound of the devs</h2><br><br>Hi everyone, it is a pleasure to bring you our first game <i>Dawn of the Lost Castle</i><br><br>As a big fan of <i>Castlevania</i>, I wanted the game to contains more exploration elements and more fights. But it didn't go well since we all lack of experiences and funds to extend the development period.  <br><br>But this won't be the end of <i>Dawn of the Lost Castle</i>, neither it will be our last game. So if you have any suggestions, please let us know through Steam Discussion.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/c35338f3a915bc3db8395a8c98daa732.poster.avif?t=1563852035\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/c35338f3a915bc3db8395a8c98daa732.webm?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1018170/extras/c35338f3a915bc3db8395a8c98daa732.mp4?t=1563852035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
